==Battleground==
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Darkjo]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is surprisingly easy for containing Gobbles with annoying obstacles, as the Wild Doges here are only at 100% magnification, severely reducing the enemy's pushing power. Money is also no issue due to the Mooths.

As always, use [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to deal with Wild Doges and damage Darkjo. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] is ideal for taking out the initial Gobble due to having little to snipe Gobble with. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]], and [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] are all very good at chipping away the Gobble during the boss wave. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] performs well against Dark Otters, and his [[Wave Attack]]s can occasionally trigger to damage Gobble as well. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] typically won't manage to get his Wave off often due to the range of Dark Otter and the piercing range of Darkjo, but if it lands, it'll chunk off a tenth of Gobble's health at level 40—his True Form will make this stage a lot easier.  Any and all [[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|cats with Toxic Immunity]] will help in this level. (e.g. [[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask Cat]] or [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Punisher.]])

